codex
The window procedure restarts production without stopping the benchmark guests or revoking their GPU access. I also found SSH entry points outside Cloudflare and one-shot readiness checks. I’m checking Docker’s host-reachability semantics and the Proxmox teardown syntax before finalizing those findings.
